# última revista
#: files/usr/share/cinnamon/cinnamon-settings/modules/cs_windows.py:90
msgid ""
"The window focus mode indicates how windows are activated. It has three "
"possible values; \"click\" means windows must be clicked in order to focus "
"them, \"sloppy\" means windows are focused when the mouse enters the window, "
"and \"mouse\" means windows are focused when the mouse enters the window and "
"unfocused when the mouse leaves the window."
msgstr ""
"O modo de foco de janelas indica como as janelas são ativadas. Existem três "
"valores possíveis: \"Clique\" significa que a janela tem de ser clicada para "
"obter o foco, \"Descuidado\" significa que a janela fica com foco quando o "
"rato entra na janela e \"Rato\" significa que a janela fica com o foco "
"quando o rato entra na janela e perde o foco quando o rato sai."

#: files/usr/share/cinnamon/cinnamon-settings/modules/cs_windows.py:93
msgid "Automatically raise focused windows"
msgstr "Elevar automaticamente as janelas com foco"

#: files/usr/share/cinnamon/cinnamon-settings/modules/cs_windows.py:99
msgid "Bring windows which require attention to the current workspace"
msgstr ""
"Enviar para a área de trabalho atual as janelas que requeiram atenção"

#: files/usr/share/cinnamon/cinnamon-settings/modules/cs_windows.py:103
msgid "Prevent applications from stealing focus"
msgstr "Prevenir que as aplicações roubem o foco"

#. It's weird to show a combo for two items. For now this is simpler to
#. explain as a switch...
#: files/usr/share/cinnamon/cinnamon-settings/modules/cs_windows.py:107
msgid "Give focus to new windows launched from a terminal"
msgstr "Dar foco às novas janelas iniciadas a partir de um terminal"

#: files/usr/share/cinnamon/cinnamon-settings/modules/cs_windows.py:108
msgid ""
"Normally, all windows created by the user are given initial focus. This "
"controls whether or not to include programs launched from a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, todas as janelas criadas pelo utilizador recebem um foco "
"inicial. Isto controla a inclusão ou não de programas iniciados a partir de "
"um terminal."

